# Frozen Workbench B0 CodeQL query suite (JavaScript/TypeScript security).
# Digest of this file is the admitted query_suite_digest.
# Resolves against prepared query-pack (--search-path) containing:
#   codeql/javascript-queries (javascript/ql/src) and codeql/suite-helpers (misc/).
# Matches CodeQL 2.15 MCR image pack layout; no actions packs.
- description: Sentinel Workbench B0 JavaScript/TypeScript security suite
- queries: .
  from: codeql/javascript-queries
- apply: code-scanning-selectors.yml
  from: codeql/suite-helpers
